  "historyNote": "#1639, eff 11-1-80; ss by #2260, eff 1-5-83; ss by #2914, eff 11-27-84; ss by #4600, eff 8-1-89; ss by #6094-B, INTERIM, eff 9-21-95, EXPIRED, 1-19-96 New. #6181-B, eff 2-5-96, EXPIRED: 2-5-04 New. #8316, eff 3-26-05; amd by #8572, eff 2-23-06; paragraphs (a), (d), (e), & (g) EXPIRED: 3-26-13; paragraphs (b), (c), and (f) EXPIRED: 2-23-14 New. #10903, eff 8-5-15; ss by #13398, eff 6-22-22 (formerly Ph 704.06) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ph 700)",
